{"unit_id":"Romebody__dsh-docx-format#card-zh","repo":"Romebody/dsh-docx-format","commit":"eb50c45ba26f2f697922385a46f586581d616eb8","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-docx-format 是一个面向 DSH 的 Word 公文排版插件，接入工具、系统提示词和工具结果钩子。它可按《通用公文格式规范》统一标题、正文、段落间距、缩进、页边距、表格和页码，也能检查文档格式偏差；工具结果中新生成的 DOCX 可在请求触发词命中时自动排队处理。另提供 docx_read 工具提取 DOCX 正文及表格文本，并支持长文档分段续读。适合需要生成、整理或核对中文公文的 DSH 用户；格式化需 Python 与 python-docx，不需要 API Key。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:274-286","index.js:516-625","index.js:724-740","lib/docxfmt.py:1630-1705","lib/docx_read.py:51-63"]}
{"unit_id":"Romebody__dsh-docx-format#card-en","repo":"Romebody/dsh-docx-format","commit":"eb50c45ba26f2f697922385a46f586581d616eb8","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-docx-format adds official-document layout tools and prompt rules to DSH. It checks or formats Word files, queues generated DOCX files when requests match a trigger, and extracts document text and tables in chunks. Formatting needs Python with python-docx; no API key is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:274-286","index.js:516-625","index.js:724-740","lib/docxfmt.py:1630-1705","lib/docx_read.py:51-63"]}
