{"unit_id":"Romebody__dsh-docx-format#feature-1","repo":"Romebody/dsh-docx-format","commit":"eb50c45ba26f2f697922385a46f586581d616eb8","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-docx-format 的功能「自动规范化新生成的公文」：工具结果中出现 DOCX 路径且请求命中触发词后，插件将文件加入队列并调用格式引擎写回规范版式。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:724-740","index.js:556-563","lib/docxfmt.py:1698-1705"]}
{"unit_id":"Romebody__dsh-docx-format#feature-2","repo":"Romebody/dsh-docx-format","commit":"eb50c45ba26f2f697922385a46f586581d616eb8","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-docx-format 的功能「检查或修复公文格式」：调用 docx_format 并选择 check 可查看格式偏差，选择 apply 会按段落、表格和页脚规则修正并写回 DOCX。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:516-557","lib/docxfmt.py:1630-1705"]}
{"unit_id":"Romebody__dsh-docx-format#feature-3","repo":"Romebody/dsh-docx-format","commit":"eb50c45ba26f2f697922385a46f586581d616eb8","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-docx-format 的功能「读取 Word 正文」：调用 docx_read 并指定路径，可提取 DOCX 段落与表格文本；长文档通过返回的 next_offset 继续读取。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:566-625","lib/docx_read.py:51-80"]}
{"unit_id":"Romebody__dsh-docx-format#feature-4","repo":"Romebody__dsh-docx-format","commit":"eb50c45ba26f2f697922385a46f586581d616eb8","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-docx-format 的功能「按请求提示公文规则」：启用提示词段后，DSH 会收到标题、正文、表格、图片和落款等 DOCX 排版规则，帮助生成时遵循约定格式。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:629-710","index.js:696-708"]}
{"unit_id":"Romebody__dsh-docx-format#caveat-1","repo":"Romebody/dsh-docx-format","commit":"eb50c45ba26f2f697922385a46f586581d616eb8","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-docx-format 使用前须知：自动排版仅在最后一条用户消息包含配置的触发词时启动，默认触发词是「公文」；显式格式工具也可用 force 参数绕过该门控。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:34-35","index.js:356-368","index.js:504-512","index.js:724-740"]}
{"unit_id":"Romebody__dsh-docx-format#caveat-2","repo":"Romebody/dsh-docx-format","commit":"eb50c45ba26f2f697922385a46f586581d616eb8","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-docx-format 使用前须知：格式引擎导入 python-docx 处理 DOCX，缺少该模块时会报错；正文读取器则使用 Python 标准库，并不包含图片或脚注文字。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/docxfmt.py:26-35","lib/docx_read.py:2-2","lib/docx_read.py:58-63"]}
